Cisco Time Series Model

CTSM 1.5 adapts parts of MultiResolutionDecoder and the RMSNorm, ResidualBlock,
and TransformerMLP layers from TimesFM. It reuses the padding sentinel (PAD_VALUE)
and adapts the TimesFM 2.5 running normalization helper. Its flip equivariance
follows TimesFM 2.5's flip-invariance and TimesFM 3.0's symmetric averaging.

